      "id": "meal-review",
      "type": "section",
      "level": 3,
      "title": "Meal Review!"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. (*꧆▽꧆*) Stumbled into this sushi joint after the Sumidagawa Fireworks festival. In the middle of an already amazing course, the chef presented us with miniature versions of the sushi he prepared! 11/10\n\n2. (ᵔ◡ᵔ) One of several convenience store snacks that got devoured. The price, taste, and ease of it all was just as everyone had said. Salmon onigiri, 10/10\n\n3. (・ω・) Had to try a maid cafe. My bear curry smiled at me as I ate his face off. Didn't expect much taste-wise, but the maids were fun and the presentation cute. 7/10\n\n4.(⌒▽⌒)☆ Cold soba. Always a treat, especially in the hot weather, 8.5/10"
    },
